OL,3,GNEWSA#600k cuts to cancer support set
OL,4,Ato be announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is set to announce more than
OL,7,F#600,000 in cuts to a signposting
OL,8,Fservice supporting cancer patients.
OL,10,FThe Cancer Navigator Service, which is
OL,11,Fbased at the Southport and Formby
OL,12,FCancer Information and Support Centre -
OL,13,Falso known as Southport Macmillan
OL,14,FCentre - provides non-medical support
OL,15,Fto patients diagnosed with cancer.
OL,17,FIt is currently funded by the Southport
OL,18,Fand Formby Primary Care Network
OL,19,F(SFPCN), which manages local funding
OL,20,Facross 14 GP practices in the borough.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
