OL,3,GNEWSA#600k cuts to cancer support set
OL,4,Ato be announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a Sefton Council report said that
OL,7,Fdue to major national funding cuts of
OL,8,F#607,000, these practices had voted
OL,9,Fthat they could no longer pay for
OL,10,Fservices sitting outside their
OL,11,Fmandatory NHS core contract.
